Package: vayuayan
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Air Quality Data Analysis for India
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mahesh Kumar", "Prajapat", email = "22b0433@iitb.ac.in", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Fetch and analyze air quality data from multiple sources including 
    CPCB (Central Pollution Control Board) India and WUSTL ACAG satellite PM2.5 data.
    Provides functions for historical and real-time AQI monitoring, geospatial 
    station location services, and satellite PM2.5 data processing.
